     9	  * for each multiplicity-free daughter d: the pairing b_d(x) = <x, z_mu y_d> and the factor
    10	    C_d with  cfp(x/|x|; d)^2 = b_d(x)^2 * C_d / q(x);
    11	  * the residue test: for every irreducible non-linear factor pi of q(phi1) (and q(phi0))
    12	    with odd multiplicity, whether -disc is a square in Q[v]/(pi).
    13	Run: $PY code/multiplicity_obstruction.py [k]
    14	"""
