     1	"""Independent first-quantized check of the CFP engine (conventions, sqrt(N), CG order).
     2	
     3	For small N, every state produced by the polynomial engine is expanded into an explicit
     4	symmetric tensor in (C^(2f+1))^(tensor N) with orthonormal one-particle basis e_m, and the CFP
     5	is recomputed from its definition
